  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 713.06 Annual Fluoride Public Notice for SMCL Exceedance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 713.06 Annual Fluoride Public Notice for SMCL Exceedance.\n\n(a) The O/O of a system where the SMCL for fluoride is exceeded shall provide annual public notice as specified in Env-Dw 800.\n\n(b) The public notice shall list the most recent sample result(s) used to determine compliance.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
